    "normalityAssumptions": "No universal no-cancellation/zero-sign argument is assumed. Every actual native result component must pass normal/+0 raw-word and pre-Float-store hash equality before cache commit. Signed/multiturn cases producing negative zero at the native producer and +0 at the attribute sink refuse as data-dependent output cases.",
    "runtime": "Existing VALUE constants only; no runtime ROTATION, Hash, texture/pass/readback or per-frame native work.",
    "snapshot": "Separate InputRotation evaluator; inherited bounded typed traversal, complete source ancestry/root/context, raw constructor properties and private16-node carrier snapshots revalidated before cache/native commit and EOF. Old Euler/Quaternion routes unchanged."
